docs {
  # Vendor API
  
  Vendor endpoints use API-key authentication.
  
  ```txt
  Authorization: {{vendorApiKey}}
  ```
  
  Do not prefix vendor API keys with `Bearer`.
  
  Vendor pricing uses active vendor rules:
  
  - Data uses per-plan `vendorPrice` when set, then vendor tier/markup fallback.
  - Airtime uses `vendorMarkupPercent`.
  - Cable TV uses per-package `vendorPrice` when set, then vendor markup fallback.
}
